aps Candidate B who handles stress well and is conscientious, despite some communication tone issues. Or we could support D but ask for more info on crew cooperation.\n\nGiven the guidelines, we should make a contribution that either supports D with nuance or challenges D. Let's challenge D a bit, pointing out that being regarded as arrogant and a loner could impair crew cooperation, which is essential for long-haul flights. Meanwhile, Candidate B shows strong stress resilience and conscientiousness, and while he can be grumpy and sometimes uses wrong tone, those may be manageable with training. So we might shift recommendation to B.\n\nWe need to reference Agent 3's recommendation. So we can say: \"I appreciate Agent 3's view on D, but I have concerns about D's arrogance and loner perception, which could affect crew cooperation. In contrast, Candidate B demonstrates strong reliability and stress handling, though he has some communication tone issues. Given the importance of crew cooperation, I lean toward B.\"\n\nWe must include explicit facts: D regarded as arrogant, D regarded as a loner. B very conscientious, handles stress very well, can be grumpy, sometimes adopts wrong tone when communicating.\n\nWe need to state our vote: Candidate B.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate B\"."}
